msgid "Lightweight Cleaning"
msgstr "轻量级清理模式"

#. translators: cleaning option row subtitle. This describes what "Lightweight cleaning" is. Please be as clear as possible and don't assume the user knows what everything is
msgid ""
"By default, the removal process might alter a bit the data of your files, in "
"order to remove as much metadata as possible. For example, texts in PDF "
"might not be selectable anymore, compressed images might get compressed "
"again… The lightweight mode, while not as thorough, will not make "
"destructive changes to your files."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，清理过程可能会轻微改变您的文件数据，以便尽可能多地移除元数据。例"
"如，PDF 中的文本可能变得不可选择，压缩图像可能会再次被压缩……轻量级模式虽然清"
"理不够彻底，但不会对您的文件造成破坏性更改。"

